{"seq":1,"slug":"rlhf-ppo-alignment","title":"RLHF 与 PPO 对齐管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/algorithms/rlhf-ppo-alignment","wordCount":1509,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"rlhf-与-ppo-对齐管线\">RLHF 与 PPO 对齐管线</h1><p>2022 年末 ChatGPT 的发布将 RLHF（Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback）从学术论文推向了全球工程实践的中心。到 2026 年，RLHF 仍然是高预算团队训练旗舰对话模型的首选方法——OpenAI、Anthropic、Meta 的主力产品均基于 RLHF 管线。但这条管线的工程复杂度极高：4 个同时在内存中的模型实例、敏感的超参数空间、以及持续的奖励黑客风险，使其成为 ML 基建领域最具挑战性的系统之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三阶段训练管线\">核心概念：三阶段训练管线</h2><p>RLHF 遵循严格的三阶段流水线，每个阶段的输出作为下一阶段的输入：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>模型数</th>\n<th>典型耗时（7B）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Stage 1: SFT</td>\n<td>预训练模型 + 示范数据</td>\n<td>SFT 模型（参考策略）</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2-5 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stage 2: RM 训练</td>\n<td>SFT 模型 + 偏好对</td>\n<td>奖励模型</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1-2 周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stage 3: PPO 优化</td>\n<td>SFT + RM + Actor + Critic</td>\n<td>对齐模型</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2-4 周</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph S1[&quot;Stage 1: SFT&quot;]&#10;        PT[&quot;预训练模型&quot;] --&gt; SFT[&quot;SFT 模型&quot;]&#10;        DATA1[&quot;示范数据&quot;] --&gt; SFT&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph S2[&quot;Stage 2: RM&quot;]&#10;        SFT2[&quot;SFT 模型副本&quot;] --&gt; RM[&quot;奖励模型&quot;]&#10;        PREF[&quot;偏好对数据&quot;] --&gt; RM&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph S3[&quot;Stage 3: PPO&quot;]&#10;        ACT[&quot;Actor(策略)&quot;] --&gt; GEN[&quot;生成响应&quot;]&#10;        GEN --&gt; RMS[&quot;RM 评分&quot;]&#10;        RMS --&gt; ADV[&quot;优势计算&quot;]&#10;        CRI[&quot;Critic&quot;] --&gt; ADV&#10;        ADV --&gt; UPD[&quot;PPO 更新&quot;]&#10;        REF[&quot;Reference(SFT 冻结)&quot;] --&gt; KL[&quot;KL 约束&quot;]&#10;        KL --&gt; UPD&#10;    end&#10;    S1 --&gt; S2&#10;    S2 --&gt; S3\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph S1[\"Stage 1: SFT\"]\n        PT[\"预训练模型\"] --&gt; SFT[\"SFT 模型\"]\n        DATA1[\"示范数据\"] --&gt; SFT\n    end\n    subgraph S2[\"Stage 2: RM\"]\n        SFT2[\"SFT 模型副本\"] --&gt; RM[\"奖励模型\"]\n        PREF[\"偏好对数据\"] --&gt; RM\n    end\n    subgraph S3[\"Stage 3: PPO\"]\n        ACT[\"Actor(策略)\"] --&gt; GEN[\"生成响应\"]\n        GEN --&gt; RMS[\"RM 评分\"]\n        RMS --&gt; ADV[\"优势计算\"]\n        CRI[\"Critic\"] --&gt; ADV\n        ADV --&gt; UPD[\"PPO 更新\"]\n        REF[\"Reference(SFT 冻结)\"] --&gt; KL[\"KL 约束\"]\n        KL --&gt; UPD\n    end\n    S1 --&gt; S2\n    S2 --&gt; S3</pre><h2 id=\"stage-3-的四模型架构\">Stage 3 的四模型架构</h2><p>PPO 阶段的核心工程挑战在于需要同时维护 4 个大模型实例：</p>\n<p><strong>Actor Model（策略模型）</strong>：初始化自 SFT 模型，是最终要部署的对齐模型。在训练中生成响应并接受 PPO 更新。</p>\n<p><strong>Critic Model（价值网络）</strong>：与 Actor 同架构，估计每个 token 位置的状态价值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(s_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。用于计算 GAE 优势估计，减少梯度方差。</p>\n<p><strong>Reward Model</strong>：Stage 2 训练得到的偏好评分器，冻结参数。对 Actor 生成的完整响应给出标量评分。</p>\n<p><strong>Reference Model（参考策略）</strong>：SFT 模型的冻结副本，用于计算 KL 散度惩罚。确保 Actor 不会偏离&quot;合理&quot;的语言分布太远。</p>\n<p>对于 7B 参数模型，这 4 个实例在 bf16 精度下需要约 56GB VRAM（每个 14GB），加上梯度和优化器状态，实际需求约 60-80GB——这就是为什么 RLHF 训练通常需要 8x A100 集群。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ppo-训练循环的工程实现\">PPO 训练循环的工程实现</h2><p>每个 PPO 训练迭代包含以下步骤：</p>\n<p><strong>1. 采样生成</strong>：从 prompt 池中抽取一批 prompt，用 Actor 自回归生成响应。这是 GPU 利用率最低的阶段（自回归解码无法充分利用批并行）。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 奖励计算</strong>：RM 对生成的响应评分，同时计算 Actor 与 Reference 之间的逐 token KL 散度。最终奖励为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>KL</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>RM</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>KL</mtext><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_t = \\begin{cases} -\\beta \\cdot \\text{KL}_t &amp; t &lt; T \\\\ r_{\\text{RM}} - \\beta \\cdot \\text{KL}_T &amp; t = T \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KL</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">RM</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KL</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即中间步只有 KL 惩罚，终端步叠加 RM 评分。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 优势估计</strong>：Critic 对轨迹中每个位置预测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(s_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，通过 GAE 计算优势 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{A}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>4. PPO 更新</strong>：在同一批数据上执行多个 epoch（通常 2-4 次）的梯度更新，每次用裁剪目标约束策略变化幅度。</p>\n<p><strong>5. Critic 更新</strong>：用 TD 目标更新价值网络：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>critic</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{critic}} = \\| V_\\phi(s_t) - (r_t + \\gamma V_{\\text{target}}(s_{t+1})) \\|^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">critic</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1002em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关键超参数与调优策略\">关键超参数与调优策略</h2><p>RLHF-PPO 的超参数空间极为敏感，微小变动可能导致训练崩溃或奖励黑客：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>超参数</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n<th>调优建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>KL 系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>0.01-0.2</td>\n<td>太小→奖励黑客；太大→能力退化</td>\n<td>从 0.05 开始，监控 KL 曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>clip_range</td>\n<td>0.1-0.3</td>\n<td>策略更新的最大步长</td>\n<td>标准 0.2，不稳定时降至 0.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GAE <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>0.9-0.99</td>\n<td>方差-偏差权衡</td>\n<td>标准 0.95</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mini_batch_size</td>\n<td>16-128</td>\n<td>梯度估计精度</td>\n<td>至少 32</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ppo_epochs</td>\n<td>1-4</td>\n<td>每批数据重复利用次数</td>\n<td>2-4，过多导致过拟合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>learning_rate</td>\n<td>1e-6 to 5e-6</td>\n<td>参数更新幅度</td>\n<td>比 SFT 低一个量级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>temperature</td>\n<td>0.7-1.0</td>\n<td>采样多样性</td>\n<td>训练用 1.0，评估用 0.7</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>自适应 KL 控制</strong>：TRL 框架实现了自适应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 调节——当 KL 超过目标值时增大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>，低于目标值时减小。这比固定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 更稳定，但需要合理设置 KL target（通常 6-12 nats）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练稳定性与常见失败模式\">训练稳定性与常见失败模式</h2><p><strong>Reward Hacking</strong>：Actor 找到了 RM 的评分漏洞——RM 分数持续上升，但人类评估质量下降。诊断信号：KL 快速增长 + RM 分数飙升 + 生成多样性骤降。</p>\n<p><strong>KL Divergence 爆炸</strong>：Actor 与 Reference 偏离过远，生成退化为重复或无意义文本。根因通常是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 设置过小或 clip_range 过大。</p>\n<p><strong>Critic 估计失准</strong>：Critic 网络未能准确估计价值函数，导致优势信号噪声过大。表现为 Actor loss 振荡、训练 reward 不稳定。</p>\n<p><strong>Entropy Collapse</strong>：策略分布坍缩到几个高分响应模板上，失去多样性。对策是增大 entropy bonus 系数或在采样时提高 temperature。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年生产级-rlhf-架构\">2026 年生产级 RLHF 架构</h2><p>到 2026 年，生产级 RLHF 系统通常采用以下架构模式：</p>\n<p><strong>多 RM 集成</strong>：训练 3-5 个独立 RM，使用中位数或裁剪均值作为最终奖励，防止单一 RM 被利用。</p>\n<p><strong>迭代式 RLHF</strong>：不是一次训练到底，而是多轮迭代——每轮 PPO 训练后收集新的偏好数据，更新 RM，再进行下一轮 PPO。这种在线 RLHF 持续缩小 RM 与真实偏好的偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>混合管线</strong>：先用 DPO 做初步对齐（低成本、快速收敛），再用短程 RLHF 做精细调优（捕获 DPO 难以优化的行为维度）。这种 DPO→RLHF 的级联在 2026 年成为主流实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RLHF 三阶段管线（SFT→RM→PPO）仍是 2026 年旗舰模型的对齐标准</li>\n<li>Stage 3 需要 4 个大模型同时在内存中运行，是显存需求最高的 ML 训练任务之一</li>\n<li>KL 系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是最关键的超参数——过小导致奖励黑客，过大导致能力退化</li>\n<li>生产系统采用多 RM 集成 + 迭代训练 + DPO 预对齐的混合策略</li>\n<li>RLHF 的 4-5% 质量领先优势在高风险商业场景中仍然值得额外投入</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章对比：<a href=\"dpo-preference-optimization\">DPO 偏好优化</a>提供了绕过 RM 和 PPO 的简化替代方案</li>\n<li>跨库参考：<a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/foundations/what-is-fine-tuning\">LLM 微调基础</a>介绍 RLHF 在整个微调工作流中的定位</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RLHF 与 PPO 对齐管线","id":"rlhf-与-ppo-对齐管线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三阶段训练管线","id":"核心概念-三阶段训练管线"},{"level":2,"text":"Stage 3 的四模型架构","id":"stage-3-的四模型架构"},{"level":2,"text":"PPO 训练循环的工程实现","id":"ppo-训练循环的工程实现"},{"level":2,"text":"关键超参数与调优策略","id":"关键超参数与调优策略"},{"level":2,"text":"训练稳定性与常见失败模式","id":"训练稳定性与常见失败模式"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年生产级 RLHF 架构","id":"2026-年生产级-rlhf-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"奖励工程与信号设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/foundations/reward-engineering"},"next":{"title":"DPO 直接偏好优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/algorithms/dpo-preference-optimization"}}